///stream1
Etsuko[notif, andydandy15, $25, Why'd u become a streamer?]: But that's okay!! As long as you stay a loyal viewer!!
Etsuko: Good question!!
Etsuko: 'Cause loneliness is agonizing!!
Etsuko: As a child, my parents were always away on business trips.
Etsuko: They'd never have time for me...
Etsuko: Whenever they were free, they'd say they were too tired to even talk with me...
Etsuko: And whenever I cried, they just told me I'm too needy and spoiled!
Etsuko: I guess I can't really blame them...
Etsuko: I was born in the aftermath of the Suzuki Crisis, so things were really tough economically and they had to work their assess off for a feasible living...
Etsuko: But still...
Etsuko: And I never really had any friends either, barely anybody at school or in my neighborhood wanted to hang out with me...
Etsuko: And in the rare times someone would talk with me and try to be my friend, they'd end up leaving me!
Etsuko: Telling me I'm too weird and clingy! 
Etsuko: The loneliness made me want to kill myself.
Etsuko: I spent my days watching streamers to distract myself from the pain of loneliness
Etsuko: And even though it took me a while, 'cause I'm retarded or something, I finally realized the solution to my loneliness!
Etsuko: Becoming a streamer myself!
Etsuko: I could be the one getting all that love and attention!
Etsuko: And money too! Maybe I can stop having to depend on an allowance from my parents!!
Etsuko[notif, ProjectAlice, $100, Cut yourself more, stupid foid.]: Every single viewer makes me happy!
Etsuko: That's a little mean...
Etsuko: But...
->Cut: set_branch, cut2
->Don't cut: set_branch, game_over
